WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.561
Here's a quick tour of Formula Forum for event partners.

2
00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:08.148
As a partner, your Today screen puts one thing first:

3
00:00:08.198 --> 00:00:09.555
getting partner-ready.

4
00:00:09.605 --> 00:00:14.605
Your short list tracks your profile, your schedule, and your partner workspace.

5
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:18.273
Partner Hub is your team's home base.

6
00:00:18.323 --> 00:00:22.601
See how complete your partner page is, then use your event tools:

7
00:00:22.651 --> 00:00:26.728
leads, attendee scanning, your QR code, posts, and your team.

8
00:00:26.778 --> 00:00:32.853
Further down, check your booking link, your pre-event checklist, and your most recent leads.

9
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.277
Tap Scan Attendee to turn a hello into a lead.

10
00:00:37.327 --> 00:00:43.942
Scanning a badge saves the attendee's name, email, and company as a lead for your organization.

11
00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:48.205
Messages keeps your follow-up conversations together.

12
00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.893
And notifications let you know when something new happens.

13
00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.177
That's Formula Forum for partners.

14
00:00:56.227 --> 00:00:59.391
This demonstration was recorded with local sample data.
